Content:
@5:53 and we respect you so much more for it!
this has been an incredible journey that we've been able to have with you, and i think anyone of us will continue to watch whatever it is you put out-- no matter if it's every couple weeks for a little check in, or twice a year.
i was just rewatching the diamond dimensions (on ep64!) and love it even more now because of nostalgia (@29:26 which i think explains why your audience is older, since us from the beginning have grown but still love the long minecraft videos, or at least i do), and simply because of your style of videos.
